    "sentence_translations": [
      "Different customs for taking wedding photos",
      "",
      "Starting in the 1980s, it has become popular for young Chinese to take a set of “wedding photos” before the wedding.",
      "In other words, they shoot a series of beautiful photos wearing wedding dress and suit.",
      "Interestingly, even though taking wedding photos is a custom passed on from Western culture, ..",
      ".. Westerners do not take wedding photos before the wedding.",
      "Instead, they take pictures on the wedding day to keep as a memory.",
      "This is because Westerners generally believe the groom should not see the bride in her wedding dress before the wedding.",
      "But China does not have this kind of tradition.",
      "For Chinese people, taking a set of formal photos wearing wedding dress and suit is a way to keep beautiful memories.",
      ""
    ]
